ery noise it hears!Explore & ProgressUncover the secrets of the house: Each room holds clues hidden within drawers, cabinets, and even behind paintings. These clues reveal the paintings that conceal hidden passageways, leading you closer to escape.NoiseSilence is your ally: Choose the wrong painting, and a deafening alarm will blare, attracting the puppet's attention. Every step you take, every drawer you open, could betray your location.Move cautiously, as even walking or running can alert the puppet to your location. Hold your breath, stay still, and wait for the danger to pass before continuing your search. Every sound you make could be your last.TrapsBeware of hidden dangers: Some drawers and cabinets contain noise traps. Trigger one, and you'll have to hide quickly! But these aren't the only traps in the house. Stay alert and avoid getting caught!EscapeCan you outsmart the puppet and escape the house? Every step is a gamble, every decision a test of your courage. Will you survive?"}